      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empire%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A bank founded in 1906 signaled Empire moved beyond a simple company‑town economy.",
